    "title": "Soccer Italy Coach",
    "text": "• Italian soccer federation Giovanni Malagò announced Roberto Mancini as the new Italy coach on Tuesday.\n• Claudio Ranieri will become the new technical director.\n• Italy has failed to qualify for the past three World Cups.\n• Mancini led the Azzurri to the European Championship title in 2021.\n• Mancini resigned as Italy coach in August 2023 and took over Saudi Arabia's national team two weeks later.\n• There will be a press conference on Wednesday with Mancini and Ranieri.",
    "summary": "- Aijaz Rahi - AP Roberto Mancini has once again been tasked with revitalizing an Italy team in crisis. Italian soccer federation Giovanni Malagò announced Mancini as the new Italy coach on Tuesday. Italy has failed to qualify for the past three World Cups. Mancini led the Azzurri to the European Championship title in 2021 but shockingly resigned as Italy coach in August 2023, taking over Saudi Arabia’s national team two weeks later. We'd love to hear eyewitness accounts, the history behind an article.",
